# Keep the build context tiny: only control_api/ and kalshi_bot/ are needed.
# Allow-list approach: ignore everything, then re-include.
*
!control_api/
!kalshi_bot/
!scripts/

# ...but never ship secrets, runtime state, caches or tests into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/bot.env
**/secrets/
**/logs/
**/state.json
**/MAKER_KILL_SWITCH
**/ARB_KILL_SWITCH
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/tests/
kalshi_bot/deploy/
kalshi_bot/Dockerfile
scripts/tests/
scripts/*.ps1
